━━━ stdout
Import Elastic Security detection rules (needs tenant credentials).

Usage: opentide generate extract elastic [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --space <SPACE>
          Kibana space ID
          
          [default: default]

      --include-prebuilt, --custom-only
          Include prebuilt rules converted to custom rules with derived UUIDs
          
          [default: custom-only]

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate extract elastic --space default

━━━ stderr · empty
